.DS_store
.vscode
.venv/
.idea/
.junie/
.ruff_cache/

# Generated trees that show up in `git status` on every branch, because they are
# left on disk by whichever branch last built them.
#
# Deliberately NOT `launcher/` wholesale: that path is tracked on `rust-main`
# (package.json, README.md, src-tauri sources), so ignoring the directory would
# hide real code the moment anyone works there. Only the generated children are
# listed. None of these paths has ever been tracked on any branch -- checked
# with `git log --all -- <path>` before adding them.
launcher/node_modules/
launcher/build/
launcher/src-tauri/gen/
launcher/.svelte-kit/

# Agent scratch space and per-machine settings. `worktrees/` is where isolated
# agent checkouts live and runs to gigabytes; `settings.local.json` is local by
# name and by nature. Anything under `.claude/` that IS meant to be shared --
# agent or skill definitions, for instance -- stays trackable, which is why this
# is not a blanket `.claude/`.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/settings.local.json
